{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52248","headline":"诗（幷序） 九 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沉沦三恶道，负持（一作「时」，松尾良树谓应作「特」）愚痴鬼。\n荒忙身卒死，即遍（张改「追」，项校作「属」）伺（张改作「司」）命使。\n反缚棒打走，先渡奈何水。\n倒拽至厅前，枷棒这（张改「遍」，郭云不误。\n）身起。\n死经一七日，刑名受罪鬼。\n牛头铁叉杈，狱（从项说补）卒（此字据《大正藏》补）把刀搨。\n碓[捣]（檮）磑磨身，覆生还覆（项校作「复」）死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52248.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52248","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}